+                        "GUAC_RDP_H264_AVC420_ONLY=0: advertising AVC444 "
+                        "without the AVC_THINCLIENT flag. A server that sends "
+                        "AVC444 will have those frames decoded and re-encoded "
+                        "rather than passed through.");
 
         }
 
